        <mxCell id="fn1" parent="1" style="text;html=1;fontSize=11;fontColor=#4A5563;fontStyle=2;align=left;verticalAlign=top;whiteSpace=wrap;" value="There’s no separate “blocked” or “in review” column — a task only ever sits in one of three places: To Do, In Progress, or Done." vertex="1">
